    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present to the market No. 21 Ely Close, a superb three-bedroom semi-detached family home situated in a quiet cul-de-sac within the mature and highly sought-after Ely Manor development. Boasting generous room proportions, a large modern kitchen extension, converted attic and a fantastic self-contained outside unit, this impressive property offers excellent accommodation both inside and out.\n\nFlooded with natural light, the property is presented in excellent condition throughout and has been extensively upgraded by its current owners. The accommodation briefly comprises entrance porch, hallway, spacious living room, large open-plan extended kitchen/dining area, utility room and downstairs WC. Upstairs there are three generous bedrooms, with the principal bedroom benefiting from an en-suite, together with the main family bathroom. The converted attic provides excellent additional accommodation.\n\nThe property has undergone extensive upgrading including a new kitchen, new flooring throughout, new Ideal Logic condensing gas boiler, Hive smart heating system with separate heating and hot water controls, new radiators throughout and upgraded bathrooms. Further improvements include new internal doors, skirting boards and architraves, electrical sockets and fittings, together with new fitted blinds throughout. (B BER)\n\nA particular highlight is the large rear garden which features a fantastic self-contained outside unit, currently used as a gym/office, complete with WC. The property also benefits from a front driveway providing ample off-street parking.\n\nEly is a mature and established development close to Tallaght Village, The Square Shopping Centre, Tallaght University Hospital and TU Dublin Tallaght Campus. A wide selection of primary and secondary schools are also nearby. The property is ideally positioned for access to the M50, N81 and N7, with numerous Dublin Bus routes servicing the area."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\n3D Tour - \nhttps://my.matterport.com/show/?m=8vmSJ2qmUse\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Superb 3-bedroom semi-detached family home</li><li> Large modern kitchen/dining extension</li><li> Converted attic</li><li> Self-contained outside unit with WC, currently used as a gym/office</li><li> Three bathrooms</li><li> Extensively upgraded throughout</li><li> New Ideal Logic condensing gas boiler & Hive smart heating system - B BER</li><li> New flooring, internal doors, skirting, architraves and electrical fittings</li><li> Extremely large front driveway with ample off-street parking</li><li> Quiet cul-de-sac location with beautiful Dublin Mountain views</ul>"
      },
